  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 9 April 2019). Our client Anjali Chatterjee is a 33-year-old restaurant owner who lives at Plot 91, Tallakulam, Madurai 625043 and can be reached on +91 74388 65819 or anjali.chatterjee@example.in. The client's PAN HZGPC5579G.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Trident Textiles Pvt Ltd. A cheque for ₹36,20,000 issued by M/s Trident Textiles Pvt Ltd bounced: the cheque was returned unpaid for insufficient funds.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 711234484512 (IFSC KKBK0539102).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 78/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Madurai on 5 July 2019.",
